{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"100417","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/100417","key":"MC-251773","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"15/May/22 2:15 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Steps to reproduce:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Download the below nbt file. (An end city structure template file.)</li>\n\t<li>Download the 22w19a server jar from <a href=\"https://launcher.mojang.com/v1/objects/c354ac562b44fe5857535935125942ff89616cab/server.jar\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this link.</a></li>\n\t<li>Put both of them in the same folder.</li>\n\t<li>Run the data generator using the below command:</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">java -DbundlerMainClass=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"net.minecraft.data.Main\"</span> -jar server.jar --dev --input &lt;path&gt;\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>...where &lt;path&gt; is the folder in which you placed the nbt file.</p>\n\n<p>You should see the following log:</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">Starting net.minecraft.data.Main\n[16:09:26] [ServerMain/INFO]: Building unoptimized datafixer\n[16:09:26] [ServerMain/INFO]: Starting provider: NBT to SNBT\n[16:09:27] [ServerMain/INFO]: Converted fat_tower_base from NBT to SNBT\n[16:09:27] [ServerMain/INFO]: NBT to SNBT finished after 49 ms\n[16:09:27] [ServerMain/INFO]: All providers took: 50 ms\n[16:09:27] [ServerMain/INFO]: Caching: total files: 1, old count: 0, <span class=\"code-keyword\">new</span> count: 1, removed stale: 1, written: 0\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>If you check the generated folder, nothing but the cache file will be there, instead of the snbt version of fat_tower_base and the cache.</p>\n\n<p>The last line, </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">[16:09:27] [ServerMain/INFO]: Caching: total files: 1, old count: 0, <span class=\"code-keyword\">new</span> count: 1, removed stale: 1, written: 0\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>Did not exist before 1.19 snapshots, and I suspect that the </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">removed stale:</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> portion has something to do with this.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"16/May/22 10:02 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/131662","id":"131662","filename":"fat_tower_base.nbt","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"CreeperMagnet_","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"customer"},"created":"15/May/22 2:01 PM","size":"2 kB","mimeType":"application/octet-stream","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/131662"}],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"18/May/22 4:22 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"20/Aug/26 4:19 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"The --dev argument for the data generators no longer converts NBT to SNBT properly","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006",